Get your food
Another part of the survey allowed selected children (204 boys and 172 girls from 13 schools) to prepare their own food on the basis of possibilities offered according to their own taste and personal opinion.
'The preferences of Czech children between the ages of 12 and 15 are a long way towards a healthy diet from an ideal.
