Luisa Maria Calderon states that the drug smugglers assisted her opponent Fausto Vallejo of the PRI in the race as governor.
President Felipe Calderon’s Sister appears to have lost her attempt to gain access to Michoacion’s governor during violent elections, and she stated on Monday that drug smuggberries favored one of her opponents.
